<br class="ltx_break">Generalization</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.6.1.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T1.6.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Average</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.6.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.6.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Diffusion Policy <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">7</a>]</cite></span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.6.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T1.6.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">62.8</span></td>
