<div id="S1a.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S1a.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1a.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Using different grasp detectors.</span> We evaluated several grasp detectors with varying performance levels as priors, as shown in the table below. Our method consistently outperforms the grasp detection baseline with traditional motion planning. Notably, the performance gain is even more significant when the initial grasp poses are <span id="S1a.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">suboptimal</span>, demonstrating the robustness and corrective capability of our proposed closed-loop diffusion-based policy.</p>
</div>
